  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, red bell pepper, and tomato, and cook until they start to soften.",
    "Add the ground beef and cook until it is no longer pink.",
    "Add the cumin powder, cayenne pepper, and salt to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Use a spoon to create small indentations in the beef mixture, and then add a small amount of spherified yuzu juice to each indentation.",
    "Serve the beef mixture over a bed of greens, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro.",
    "Drizzle the remaining yuzu juice over the top of the dish."
